title: Extended Cloud Storage and IAM Enumeration Over Multi-Day Dwell
id: 8d1e2f3a-4b5c-4d7e-f6a7-9b0c1d2e3f05
status: experimental
description: Detects sustained low-and-slow enumeration of S3 buckets, IAM roles, and CloudFront distributions from the same principal across multiple days, matching TraderTraitor's patient environment-mapping dwell time (approximately 12 days in the Bybit intrusion) before executing theft.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://www.sygnia.co/blog/sygnia-investigation-bybit-hack/
tags:
    - attack.discovery
    - attack.t1526
logsource:
    category: application
    service: aws_cloudtrail
detection:
    selection:
        eventName:
            - 'ListBuckets'
            - 'ListRoles'
            - 'ListDistributions'
            - 'GetBucketPolicy'
    timeframe: 7d
    condition: selection | count() by userIdentity.arn > 20
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate security or cloud posture management tooling performing scheduled scans
level: medium

